{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"pie","model_identifier":"pie","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## pie\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.5..4.5, y -1.0..3.2, z -9.0..0.0 (size 9.0 x 4.2 x 9.0 u = 25 x 12 x 25 cm).\nPie: a round golden-crusted pie (~25 cm) in a tin, with a crimped darker rim, a domed lid and a cross-cut steam vent; carried flat in both hands. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.0.\n"},"description":"## pie\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.5..4.5, y -1.0..3.2, z -9.0..0.0 (size 9.0 x 4.2 x 9.0 u = 25 x 12 x 25 cm).\nPie: a round golden-crusted pie (~25 cm) in a tin, with a crimped darker rim, a domed lid and a cross-cut steam vent; carried flat in both hands. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"tin","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,-1.0,-8.5],"to":[4.0,0.5,-0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,17,14.0,18.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[14,17,22.0,18.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22,17,30.0,18.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,23,8.0,24.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[18,0,26.0,8.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,9,8.0,17.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a100ca1d-5176-57b2-aa2c-50d8aaa30bbe"}